# Loaded by `sanity dev` only, never by `sanity build` or `sanity deploy`, so
# the Studio built for staff never shows the development dataset. Not a
# secret, so committed. See sanity.config.ts.
#
# Committed, so never put a token here. The site's secrets go in .env at the
# repo root (see .env.example there).
SANITY_STUDIO_SHOW_DEVELOPMENT_DATASET=true
